<p>Zainab ye fugha karti thi tum aankhe to kholo <br />
naadaa'n mere bacho<br />
Is dukh zadi amma ke khule baal to dekho<br />
__________________________________</p>

<p>Ae auno mohammed mai tumhe laau kaha'n se, paaungi kaha'n se<br />
aata nahi sadqe gayi dunya se gaya jo<br />
__________________________________</p>

<p>Mai dard ki maari hu musibat me phasi hu, jangal me luti hu<br />
be aas ke sadqe gayi tum aas na todo<br />
__________________________________</p>

<p>Maa sadqe gayi tha abhi tum dono ka kya sin, marne ke na the din<br />
hae hae mere gul pairahano tashnadahaano<br />
__________________________________</p>

<p>Uth baitho bas ab syede mazloom ke pyaaro, aye raaj dulaaro<br />
khud dard ki maari hai na amma ko rulaao<br />
__________________________________</p>

<p>Pyaaro'n ko mere kis ki nazar khaa gayi hae hae, mout aa gayi hae hae<br />
band aankhei'n hai sadqe gayi is neend ko taalo<br />
__________________________________</p>

<p>Ghurbat me meri jaan kafan laau kaha'n se, kya ho sake maa se<br />
be ghuslo kafan gulshane jannat ko sidhaaro<br />
__________________________________</p>

<p>Gul pairahano gulbadano gesuo'n waalo, amma ko sambhaalo<br />
is daai ko paiwande zamee'n karke sidhaaro<br />
__________________________________</p>

<p>Lo jaao khuda haafizo naasir mere pyaaro, dunya se sidhaaro<br />
jangal me kamaai meri mitthi me milaao<br />
</p>